# Every binary asset must travel through git untouched.
#
# The original WebP launcher icons and the Roborazzi golden screenshot in this
# repository were destroyed by a text pipeline (UTF-8 lossy decode + CRLF
# normalisation) before they were ever committed -- see ERROR_AUDIT.md 1.1.
# Marking the binary globs here makes git store them as-is and fail loudly
# instead of silently re-encoding them.

*.webp   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks    binary
*.base64 binary
*.aar    binary
*.so     binary

# Text files: normalise line endings, but never for assets.
* text=auto eol=lf
